\f[B]\-\-audio\-gain\-beeper\-db\f[R] \f[I]DB\f[R]
Set host gain for beeper EAR/MIC/tape\-EAR audio from \-24 dB to +24 dB.
.TP
\f[B]\-\-audio\-gain\-ay0\-db\f[R] \f[I]DB\f[R]
Set host gain for TurboSound AY chip 0 from \-24 dB to +24 dB.
.TP
\f[B]\-\-audio\-gain\-ay1\-db\f[R] \f[I]DB\f[R]
Set host gain for TurboSound AY chip 1 from \-24 dB to +24 dB.
.TP
\f[B]\-\-audio\-gain\-ay2\-db\f[R] \f[I]DB\f[R]
Set host gain for TurboSound AY chip 2 from \-24 dB to +24 dB.
.TP
\f[B]\-\-audio\-gain\-dac\-db\f[R] \f[I]DB\f[R]
Set host gain for Specdrum, Soundrive and Covox DAC audio from \-24 dB
