\f[B]\-\-benchmark\-label\f[R] \f[I]NAME\f[R]
Workload label printed verbatim in the \f[CR]BENCH\f[R] line (default:
the loaded file\(cqs basename, or \f[CR]boot\-<machine>\f[R]).
No whitespace, since the \f[CR]BENCH\f[R] line is space\-delimited.
.TP
\f[B]\-\-delayed\-screenshot\f[R] \f[I]FILE\f[R]
Save a PNG screenshot after a delay.
.TP
\f[B]\-\-delayed\-screenshot\-time\f[R] \f[I]N\f[R]
Delay in seconds (default 10).
.TP
\f[B]\-\-delayed\-screenshot\-frames\f[R] \f[I]N\f[R]
Delay in frames.
